			templ_7745c5c3_Err = templruntime.WriteString(templ_7745c5c3_Buffer, 1, "<section class=\"about\"><p class=\"about-statement\">Safer space policy</p><p class=\"about-body\">DECAY is a safer space, which means that we intend to create a welcoming environment where marginalized folks can let their freak flags fly. We urge participants and attendees to consider how their words and actions affect others, and strive towards mutual respect.</p><p class=\"about-body\">Advocates for Youth describes a safe space as:</p><blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">A place where anyone can relax and be fully self-expressed, without fear of being made to feel uncomfortable, unwelcome, or unsafe on account of sex, race/ethnicity, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, cultural background, age, or physical or mental ability; a place where the rules guard each person's self-respect and dignity and strongly encourage everyone to respect others.</blockquote></section><section class=\"events\"><span class=\"section-label mono\">Follow these guidelines</span><ul class=\"prose-bullets\"><li>Be responsible and accountable for your words and actions; know that intent does not negate impact</li><li>Inquire about and respect the boundaries of others</li><li>Respect peoples' differing opinions, beliefs, points of view and states of being</li><li>Don't bring drugs, alcohol or weapons into the space</li><li>Just don't be a jerk! It ain't hard!</li></ul></section><section class=\"about\"><span class=\"section-label mono\">We will not tolerate</span><ul class=\"prose-bullets\"><li>Racism, transphobia, ableism, homophobia, sexism, classism, fatphobia, ageism, nazism, glorifying hate groups in general, and all the other bad isms and phobias</li><li>Disrespectful behavior towards the space, attendees, or neighborhood</li><li>Disruptive behavior that prevents your fellow attendees from having a good time</li><li>Sexual harassment, inappropriate comments, jokes, behaviors, or touching</li><li>Physical, sexual, verbal, emotional abuse or intimidation</li><li>Theft from the space or attendees</li><li>Bringing weapons into the space</li></ul><p class=\"about-body\"><strong>We reserve the right to refuse admittance to or eject anyone who violates our safer spaces policy at our discretion.</strong></p><p class=\"about-body\">We host events that we feel align with our mission. Content is not pre-screened in full or censored prior to events, nor can we promise to preemptively mute all oppressive or problematic behaviors by participants or attendees. If you see something, say something!</p><p class=\"about-body\">If you encounter something oppressive or problematic, witness or experience prohibited language or behaviors, or are made to feel unsafe, please reach out to the staff and we will collaborate on a solution with you.</p><p class=\"about-body\">DECAY reserves the right to ask anyone in violation of the safer space policy to leave the space (either temporarily or permanently) and we strive to take into account the wishes of the harmed party. We are not professional mediators; we are just people who are trying our best to make sure everyone has a good time.</p><p class=\"about-body\"><strong>Thank you for your support and assistance in making DECAY a safer space.</strong></p></section><section class=\"events\"><span class=\"section-label mono\">Report concerns</span><p class=\"about-body\">Email <a href=\"mailto:concerns@decayolympia.org\">concerns@decayolympia.org</a>.</p></section>")
